'''Brine Road''' is a water route that is split in two by an [[Old Shipwreck]]. The Western side connects [[Kindle Road]] to [[Boon Island]] and to the [[Deep Sea]].

==Items==
{{ItemTable/Header}}
{{ItemTable/Data|SCUBAGEAR||Scuba Gear|Given by the swimmer after giving 5 Deep Sea Scales.|ScubaGear_BrineRoad.png}}
{{ItemTable/Data|HEARTSCALE||Heart Scale|Hidden by a rock near the Old Shipwreck.|HeartScale1_BrineRoad.png}}
{{ItemTable/Data|NUGGET||Nugget|West of the path for Boon Island.|Nugget_BrineRoad.png}}
{{ItemTable/Data|HEARTSCALE||Heart Scale|Hidden by a rock behind the Corsolas.|HeartScale2_BrineRoad.png}}
{{ItemTable/Data|SUNSTONE||Sun Stone|Blocked by Corsolas.|SunStone_BrineRoad.png}}
{{ItemTable/Footer}}

